com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1475670-hunter-2e-is-out-on-dtrpg?p=1475701#post1475701\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">That's all of them, yea. Which means for now and whenever a CofD 3e happens, it's just gonna be supplements.<br /> <br /> (...and honestly I don't think a 12th full gameline is happening anytime soon)</div> </div> </div> </div>I mean really that\u2019s what I want to see is more supplements, please and thank you.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /> WoD-Dark Eras!! (Backed for Viking Age Werewolf)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1939-lyrics-of-war","name":"Lyrics Of War","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1939_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1769"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-03-03T15:41:59-08:00","id":1475749,"title":"","content":"I wasn't able to keep up with the 2e developments, is the second edition enough of a departure to pick up if you already have the first?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1007-merinoc","name":"Merinoc","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"43"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-03-03T16:04:52-08:00","id":1475752,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Merinoc</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1475670-hunter-2e-is-out-on-dtrpg?p=1475749#post1475749\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I wasn't able to keep up with the 2e developments, is the second edition enough of a departure to pick up if you already have the first?</div> </div> </div> </div>I think I'm one of the coldest opinions on Hunter 2nd, and I would still strongly recommend getting it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-03-04T15:36:50-08:00","id":1475802,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1475670-hunter-2e-is-out-on-dtrpg?p=1475752#post1475752\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I think I'm one of the coldest opinions on Hunter 2nd, and I would still strongly recommend getting it.</div> </div> </div> </div>Why Cold? Just a vibe?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /> WoD-Dark Eras!! (Backed for Viking Age Werewolf)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1939-lyrics-of-war","name":"Lyrics Of War","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1939_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1769"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-03-04T21:46:38-08:00","id":1475821,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lyrics Of War</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1475670-hunter-2e-is-out-on-dtrpg?p=1475802#post1475802\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Why Cold? Just a vibe?</div> </div> </div> </div>There is a tonal approach that I find cleaner both to mystery and the questions of accountability (though let's not read that the wrong way-Hunter 2nd still wants you tunderstand that they're not the good guys) and is less entangled in the monsters it hunts than 1st Edition that I find cooling in terms of my relationship with the material. I also have some got some gripe about the diversity of endowments for the Conspiracies, but if you're reached this point in the synopsis, you'll find that a lot of this is flavor issue, and I won't pretend to have actual gripes with 2nd Edition.<br /> <br /> Hunter 2nd still brings a lot of what's good about 2nd Edition to to Hunter, and for the most part keeps things sharpened up. I can see an argument to keep with an application of Mortal Remains update to 1st Edition material, but it's honestly just better on the whole to take the leap to 2nd Edition.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-03-05T00:59:48-08:00","id":1475826,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1475670-hunter-2e-is-out-on-dtrpg?p=1475821#post1475821\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">There is a tonal approach that I find cleaner both to mystery and the questions of accountability (though let's not read that the wrong way-Hunter 2nd still wants you tunderstand that they're not the good guys) and is less entangled in the monsters it hunts than 1st Edition that I find cooling in terms of my relationship with the material. I also have some got some gripe about the diversity of endowments for the Conspiracies, but if you're reached this point in the synopsis, you'll find that a lot of this is flavor issue, and I won't pretend to have actual gripes with 2nd Edition.<br /> <br /> Hunter 2nd still brings a lot of what's good about 2nd Edition to to Hunter, and for the most part keeps things sharpened up. I can see an argument to keep with an application of Mortal Remains update to 1st Edition material, but it's honestly just better on the whole to take the leap to 2nd Edition.</div> </div> </div> </div>That\u2019s really a lot of how I feel about things generally. But in the spirit of chronicles it is a giant tool box, so I\u2019ve just been running second edition and modifying the elements to what seems to work with my group. Besides, the tone is largely dependent on the ST anyway.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /> WoD-Dark Eras!! (Backed for Viking Age Werewolf)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1939-lyrics-of-war","name":"Lyrics Of War","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1939_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1769"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-03-05T02:22:48-08:00","id":1475827,"title":"","content":"Maybe they are going to make more supplements now that they are done with the lines or perhaps they are prepping for a 20th anniversary edition for all the lines, I know thats impossible but one can only dream...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27142-newb95"